<title>JAPAN: S'tomo Met to cut parent capex in 97/98.</title>
<headline>S'tomo Met to cut parent capex in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Metal Industries Ltd T said on Thursday it plans parent capital investment of about 70 billion yen for the year starting on April 1, down from an estimated 125 billion yen in 1996/97.</p>
</text>
